e\"><p>所有存款</p></td>\n                                        <td class=\"color-dark-blue\"><h4>3.088% p.a.</h4></td>\n                                    </tr>\n                            \n                        </tbody>\n                    </table>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"footer-美元\" class=\"footer-content \" style=\"\">\n                    <span class=\"typography-xs\">\n                        年利率以下列年度计算，以单利息基准按日计算（包括闰年和非闰年）：<br>\n•\t港元 – 365天<br>\n•\t人民币, 美元 – 360 天<br>\n以上活期利率于2024年12月21日起生效。年利率将会按市场环境调整。你可随时用livi 理慧银行app查看最新年利率。 \n                    <div class=\"terms-and-conditions-container\">\n                            <a href=\"/pdf/livi-save-and-earn-offer-tncs-cn.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"typography-xs color-link-blue text-decoration-underline\">条款及细则</a>\n                    </div>\n                </span></div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" language=\"JavaScript\" src=\"/.resources/livibank-templates/webresources/js/twoColumnTableWithTnC.js\"></script>    <style type=\"text/css\">\n        section.section-834{padding-top: 50px;padding-bottom: 50px;}\nsection.section-834.greybg{ background-color:#E5E5E5;}\nsection.section-834 .content {  width: 100%; max-width: 960px;}\n.no-gutters>.col, .no-gutters>[class*=col-] {padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;}\n.image-content img{width: 100%;}\n.text-content h1{ margin-bottom: 20px;}\n.text-content .typography-body{ margin-bottom: 20px;}\n.qr-container{margin-top: 20px;}\n\n@media (max-width: 768.98px){\n.button-container a{width: 100%;}\n}\n    </style>\n    <script>\n      $(function() {\n        if ($(\"#main-placeholder-tmp\").length ) {\n          $(\"#main-placeholder-tmp\").find(\"main\").unwrap();\n        }\n      });\n    </script>\n    <section class=\"section-834 imagesAndTextComponent  \">\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"row no-gutters align-items-center\">\n\n         <!-- Desktop text and cta button-->\n      <div class=\"col-12 order-1 col-md-6 order-md-1\">\n        <div class=\"text-content\">\n          <div class=\"logo-container \"> </div>\n          <h1 class=\"color-dark-blue \">定期存款</h1>\n          <div class=\"typography-body color-dark-blue body livi-rich-text-editor\">提供港币、人民币及美元定期存款。何时存、怎样存，定期存款^由你决定。稳存稳赚，轻松累积财富。<br><span class=\"small\"><sup>^</sup>受livi理慧银行服务条款约束。详情请 <a href=\"https://www.livibank.com/pdf/zh_CN/cfs.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">按此</a>。\n                    <br>风险披露: \n目前人民币并非完全可自由兑换。倘若你选择将外币及人民币存款兑换为其他货币时的汇率较当初兑换外币及人民币时的汇率为差，则可能会因而蒙受本金损失。客户应事先考虑及了解因此在人民币资金方面可能受到的影响。</span></div>\n          <div class=\"cta-container hide-mobile\">\n            <div class=\"button-container\"> <a href=\"/zh_CN/download-app.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"button-primary typography-button text-decoration-none\" style=\"padding: 0 20px;\">下载 App</a> </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n        <!-- End of Desktop text and cta button-->\n\n      <div class=\"col-12 order-2 col-md-6 order-md-2\">\n        <div class=\"image-content d-flex justify-content-center\"> <img src=\"https://www.livibank.com/dam/livi1/features/liviSave/TimeDeposit/Space_2Accounts_tc-1x.webp\" alt=\"This is Title\"> </div>\n      </div>\n\n         <!-- Mobile cta button (hide in desktop)-->\n      <div class=\"col-12 order-3 col-md-6 order-md-1 hide-desktop\">\n        <div class=\"text-content\">\n          <div class=\"cta-container\">\n            <div class=\"button-container\"> <a href=\"/zh_CN/download-app.html\" class=\"button-primary typography-button text-decoration-none\" style=\"padding: 0 20px;\">下载 App</a> </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n         <!-- End of Mobile cta button (hide in desktop)-->\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" id=\"style_tdrate\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/.resources/livibank-templates/webresources/css/tdRate.css\">\n<script>\n$(function () {\n  let start = 1,\n    end = 2;\n  let max = $($(\".time-deposit-rate-table-container-mobile tr\")[0]).children().length;\n  function updateColumns() {\n     $(\".time-deposit-rate-table-container-mobile tr\").each(function (index, row) {\n      $(row).children().each(function (index, item) {\n          if(index == 0){\n            $(item).css(\"display\", \"table-cell\");\n            $(item).css(\"width\", \"150px\");\n            $(item).css(\"max-width\", \"30%\");\n          }\n          else if(index >= start && index <= end){\n            $(item).css(\"display\", \"table-cell\");\n          } else {\n            $(item).hide();\n          }\n      });\n    });\n    $(\".time-deposit-rate-table-container-mobile thead tr\").first().children().each(function (index, item) {\n        if (index == 0) {\n          $(item).css(\"border-top-left-radius\", \"15px\");\n        }\n        else if (index == end) {\n          $(item).css(\"border-top-right-radius\", \"15px\");\n        }\n        else{\n          $(item).css(\"border-top-right-radius\", \"0px\");\n        }\n      });\n    $(\".time-deposit-rate-table-container-mobile tbody tr\").last().children().each(function (index, item) {\n        if (index == 0) {\n          $(item).css(\"border-bottom-left-radius\", \"15px\");\n        }\n        else if (index == end) {\n          $(item).css(\"border-bottom-right-radius\", \"15px\");\n        }\n        else{\n          $(item).css(\"border-bottom-right-radius\", \"0px\");\n        }\n      });\n  }\n  function checkNavShow() {\n    if (start <= 1) {\n      {\n        $(\".prev-nav\").hide();\n      }\n    } else {\n      $(\".prev-nav\").show();\n    }\n    if (end >= max-1) {\n      {\n        $(\".next-nav\").hide();\n      }\n    } else {\n      $(\".next-nav\").show();\n    }\n  }\n  $(\".prev-nav\").click(() => {\n    if (start > 1) {\n      start--;\n      end--;\n      checkNavShow()\n      updateColumns()\n    }\n  });\n  $(\".next-nav\").click(() => {\n    if (end < max) {\n        start++;\n        end++;\n        checkNavShow()\n        updateColumns()\n    }\n  });\n  $(\".prev-nav\").hide()\n  updateColumns()\n});\n</script>\n<section class=\"time-deposit-rate-table-container\" style=\"padding-left: 24px;padding-right: 24px;display:flex;font-family:gilroy-regular,ambit-bold,sans-serif;flex-direction: column;justify-content: center;align-items: center;background-color:#F5F6F9;\">\n    <div class=\"content\">\n        <div class=\"title-content\" style=\"\">\n            <h1 class=\"td-rate-title color-dark-blue title\">存款期及年利率 (HKD)</h1>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <table class=\"time-deposit-rate-table time-deposit-rate-table-container-desktop\" style=\"border-radius:16px;width: 80%;max-width: 1000px;\">\n        <thead>\n                <tr style=\"border-top-left-radius: 15px;border-top-right-radius: 15px;\">\n                    <th>存入金额（HKD） </th>\n                            <th class=\"text-wrap\">500 - 5万以下</th>\n                            <th class=\"text-wrap\">5万+</th>\n                </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"font-family:gilroy-bold,ambit-bold,sans-serif;\">7 日\n                                </td><td class=\"text-wrap\">0.25%\n                                </td><td class=\"text-wrap\">0.25%\n\n                        </td></tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"font-family:gilroy-bold,ambit-bold,sans-serif;\">1 个月\n                                </td><td class=\"text-wrap\">0.50%\n                                </td><td class=\"text-wrap\">1.20%\n\n                        </td></tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"font-family:gilroy-bold,ambit-bold,sans-serif;\">2 个月\n                                </td><td class=\"text-wrap\">0.50%\n                                </td><td class=\"text-wrap\">0.50%\n\n                        </td></tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"font-family:gilroy-bold,ambit-bold,sans-serif;\">3 个月\n                                </td><td class=\"text-wrap\">1.10%\n                                </td><td class=\"text-wrap\">2.60%\n\n                        </td></tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"font-family:gilroy-bold,ambit-bold,sans-serif;\">4 个月\n                                </td><td class=\"text-wrap\">1.20%\n                        "
